<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;I can brute force this, but certainly don't know how to do it with elegance and brevity.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Suppose I have an XML fragment like:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;code&gt;
&lt;foo&gt;3&lt;/foo&gt;
&lt;foo&gt;14&lt;/foo&gt;
&lt;foo&gt;159&lt;/foo&gt;
[...]
&lt;/code&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I want to change that data to sequential numbering, ie.:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;code&gt;
&lt;foo&gt;1&lt;/foo&gt;
&lt;foo&gt;2&lt;/foo&gt;
&lt;foo&gt;3&lt;/foo&gt;
[...]
&lt;/code&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Is there a reasonably compact way of doing that (preferably without using additional modules)?&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Thank you in advance.&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
